{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDQCuWWZGYj883X55xMF", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**文书院宫（Palazzo della Cancelleria）。**\n\n它于约 1489–1513 年间为枢机主教拉斐尔·里亚里奥（Raffaele Riario）建造，常被称为罗马第一座从地基起全新按文艺复兴风格建造的宫殿。\n\n有时也有人说威尼斯宫（Palazzo Venezia，1455 年起建）是罗马最早的文艺复兴宫殿之一。不过它带有不少中世纪城堡式的元素，而且部分利用了原有建筑。所以\"第一座从零开始按新风格建造\"的说法，通常指的是文书院宫。\n\n（以上凭记忆回答，未联网核实。）"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1756, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1568, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1756}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T11:21:25.282Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDQCuGsLZhWmQAJkEYtQ"}
